                                "text": "uncivil behavior"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "89803ea6-c8a7-40eb-912c-277363f3cf81",
                                "sense_id": "e8b58216-0552-36fc-9dab-02b0c9c37f35",
                                "text": "John Terry and Frank Lampard would not have reacted as the Nigerian did to the (admittedly X-rated) challenge that led to the Liverpool forward being sent off in last week’s Carling Cup quarter-final against Chelsea. All very dangerous, all very uncivil."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "bd9b65bb-37ee-4694-ba72-35821cda4806",
                                "sense_id": "e8b58216-0552-36fc-9dab-02b0c9c37f35",
                                "text": "But since you probably weren’t there, and be thankful for that, here is a quick primer on local, uncivil civics so that you might appreciate the recent political clamor in this part of eastern Tennessee."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
